        "source_file_sha": "1f91d796404c84fa993cebf45ef0e3dea0759628",
        "lead_summary": "The sanctuary took a policy hit, not a rate hit. On Tuesday the Section 232 tariffs on patented drugs took effect; on Wednesday CMS finalized GLOBE, a model that ties Medicare Part B rebates to prices in 19 other countries \u2014 and XLV fell 1.4% on 12.1M shares, then another 1.3% Thursday, through its 50-day. This was the week the 10-year touched 5.34% and the hike got priced out, and neither mattered: the fund lost 2.6% while the S&P lost 0.2%. All fourteen tracked top holdings fell. Regeneron -6.7%, J&J -5.6% ten days before it opens earnings season. XLV $166.18, RSI 42.6, a dollar and a half above the September floor.",
